WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.467
A real Tholi widget is open on Wikipedia. Enter a destination once.

2
00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:08.261
Tholi highlights the live Text: Large control and explains the next step.

3
00:00:08.261 --> 00:00:11.669
Choose Large in Wikipedia’s Appearance controls.

4
00:00:11.669 --> 00:00:14.094
Wikipedia’s Large text preference is selected. Tholi verifies the preference change and shows a completion check.
